%% Meridian User Flow Diagrams
%% Updated by user-flow audit agent (comprehensive audit)

%% ─── Diagram 1: Primary Admin User Journey (Happy Path + Error Paths) ───────

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant LP as /login
    participant CB as /auth/callback
    participant CC as / (Command Center)
    participant MB as /members
    participant MP as /members/[id]
    participant RV as /revenue
    participant MK as /marketing
    participant CN as /campaigns/new
    participant AN as /analytics
    participant EMP as /employee

    Note over U,MW: Unauthenticated user
    U->>MW: GET /
    MW-->>U: 302 /login?redirect=/

    U->>LP: Email + password (or toggle to magic link)
    alt Password sign-in
        LP-->>LP: signInWithPassword
        LP-->>LP: Fetch profile.roles
        alt Admin/Owner/Manager
            LP-->>CC: router.push("/")
        else Trainer/Staff only
            LP-->>EMP: router.push("/employee")
        end
    else Magic link
        LP-->>U: "Check your email" state (no back navigation)
        U->>CB: GET /auth/callback?code=...
        CB-->>CB: exchangeCodeForSession
        CB-->>CB: Fetch profile.roles
        alt Admin role
            CB-->>CC: 302 /
        else Trainer/Staff only
            CB-->>EMP: 302 /employee
        end
    end

    Note over U,CC: Daily operator flow
    U->>CC: Load Command Center
    CC-->>CC: useCommandCenterData (60s poll) + useKpiData

    opt Click member in Activity Feed
        Note right of CC: DEAD END — activity items are div.cursor-pointer with no href
    end

    opt Click "View All" on Class Status Board
        Note right of CC: DEAD END — button has no href/onClick navigation
    end

    opt Click AI insight action button
        Note right of CC: DEAD END — button renders but has no routing logic
    end

    U->>MB: Sidebar → Members
    MB-->>MB: Search, filter tabs, 60s poll
    U->>MP: Click member row → /members/[id]
    MP-->>MP: SSR: member + member_360 + bookings + transactions (last 20 each)
    U->>MB: ArrowLeft "Back to Members"

    Note over U,RV: Revenue review
    U->>RV: Sidebar → Revenue
    RV-->>RV: Tabs: Overview | Memberships | Transactions
    Note right of RV: No /revenue/transactions/[id] page — no drill-down

    Note over U,CN: Campaign creation
    U->>MK: Sidebar → Marketing
    MK-->>CN: "New Campaign" link
    CN-->>CN: Step 1 Audience, Step 2 Content, Step 3 Schedule
    alt Draft saved
        CN-->>MK: a href="/marketing" (back button, bypasses /campaigns list)
    else Campaign sent
        CN-->>MK: a href="/marketing" on success screen
    end

    Note over U,AN: Analytics
    U->>AN: Sidebar → Analytics
    AN-->>AN: KPI cards, charts, AI recommendations
    U->>AN: /analytics/kpi (KPI Deep Dive)
    U->>AN: /analytics/trainers → /analytics/trainers/[id]
    U->>AN: /analytics/reports → /analytics/reports/new or /analytics/reports/[id]

    Note over U: Settings — no sidebar link — URL must be known


